# These tests fail because Brave's kPartitionConnectionsByNetworkIsolationKey
# feature being on by default.
-WebSocketEndToEndTest.HstsHttpsToWebSocket
-WebSocketEndToEndTest.HstsWebSocketToHttps
-WebSocketMultiNetworkTest.HTTP2DefaultNetworkIsCorrectlyPropagated
-WebSocketMultiNetworkTest.HTTP2DifferentTargetNetworksNeverShareConnections
